<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) - Piet Mondrian</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--r:#d40920;--b:#1356a2;--y:#f7d842;--k:#111;--w:#f6f4ee;--g:#c9c7c0;--line:14px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--k);color:var(--k);font:18px/1.55 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif}
.grid{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:var(--line);min-height:100vh;
 grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr 2.4fr;grid-template-rows:auto 1.4fr auto auto}
.grid>*{background:var(--w);padding:clamp(16px,3vw,40px)}
h1,h2{font-family:"Archivo Black",sans-serif;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.2rem)}
h2{font-size:1.15rem;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.5em}
.red{background:var(--r);color:#fff;grid-column:3;grid-row:1/3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
.title{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:1}
.kicker{font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1em}
.facts{grid-column:1;grid-row:2}
dl dt{font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-top:.8em}
.why{grid-column:2;grid-row:2/4}
.blue{background:var(--b);color:#fff;grid-column:1;grid-row:3/5}
.move{grid-column:3;grid-row:3}
.yellow{background:var(--y);grid-column:3;grid-row:4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1em;flex-wrap:wrap}
.grey{background:var(--g);grid-column:2;grid-row:4}
a.cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--k);color:var(--w);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:.8em 1.2em;border:0}
a.cta:hover,a.cta:focus-visible{background:var(--b);outline:4px solid var(--k)}
.red p{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:32ch}
@media (max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:none}.grid>*{grid-column:1!important;grid-row:auto!important}.red{min-height:40vh}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.grid>*{animation:in .6s both}.grid>*:nth-child(2n){animation-delay:.15s}@keyframes in{from{opacity:0}}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="grid">
 <header class="title">
  <p class="kicker">Piet Mondrian &middot; 1930 &middot; De Stijl</p>
  <h1>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1>
 </header>
 <section class="red" aria-label="The picture">
  <h2>The picture</h2>
  <p>A large red square at the top right, a small blue square at the bottom left and a small yellow rectangle at the bottom right, divided by thick black lines on a white ground.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="facts">
  <h2>At a glance</h2>
  <dl>
   <dt>Painter</dt><dd>Piet Mondrian (1872-1944), Dutch painter</dd>
   <dt>Year</dt><dd>1930</dd>
   <dt>Medium</dt><dd>Oil on canvas</dd>
   <dt>Collection</dt><dd>Kunsthaus Zurich</dd>
   <dt>Also listed as</dt><dd>Composition II in Red, Blue, and Yellow</dd>
  </dl>
 </section>
 <section class="why">
  <h2>Why it matters</h2>
  <p>Its asymmetric balance of a few primary-colour blocks became a reference for modern graphic design and architecture.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="blue" aria-label="Neoplasticism">
  <h2>Neoplasticism</h2>
  <p>Only horizontal and vertical lines. The three primary colours red, blue and yellow, and the non-colours white, grey and black.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="move">
  <h2>The movement</h2>
  <p>De Stijl, founded in the Netherlands in 1917 by Theo van Doesburg and Piet Mondrian.</p>
 </section>
 <div class="grey" aria-hidden="true"></div>
 <section class="yellow">
  <h2 style="margin:0">Read the full story</h2>
  <a class="cta" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Composition_with_Red,_Blue_and_Yellow" rel="noopener">Wikipedia &rarr;</a>
 </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>

